OL,3,GNEWSASwan shot in 'incredibly
OL,4,Aupsetting' incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA swan found on a town's high street
OL,7,Fwas later discovered to have been shot
OL,8,Fin what a wildlife charity has
OL,9,Fdescribed as "incredibly upsetting".
OL,11,FCharity Swan Support said it was called
OL,12,Fto a swan on Bartholomew Street in
OL,13,FNewbury after eyewitnesses had seen it
OL,14,Ffall from the roof of a building.
OL,16,FThe charity said when the swan was
OL,17,Fchecked over, a suspicious lump was
OL,18,Ffound, and a subsequent X-ray showed
OL,19,Fthree airgun pellets lodged in the
OL,20,Fswan's body. It said the swan survived
OL,21,Fand has since undergone surgery.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
